// Version: 2.2.0
// GitHub: https://github.com/jcornierfra/TradingView_Indicator_JCO_Directional_Day_5m
//
// Description: Indicateur Risk Assessment NY AM + NY PM bati sur deux etudes
//              statistiques distinctes :
//              - AM : "Anticiper les explosions sur la session NY AM" (PDF v2,
//                Mai 2026, 340 jours, 46 explosions >= 200 pts c2).
//              - PM : "NQ Anticipation NY PM Score v4" (Mai 2026, 334 jours,
//                explosions >= 150 pts c2, recall ROUGES 51%).
//
//              Objectif AM : a 15h20 Paris (10 min avant l'ouverture NY AM),
//              classer la journee selon son risque d'explosion en 6 niveaux,
//              sur la base d'un score composite a 5 leviers + 2 filtres
//              extremes + 1 alerte tardive a 15h40.
//
//              Objectif PM : a 18h20 Paris (10 min avant l'ouverture NY PM),
//              classer la session selon son risque d'explosion en 7 niveaux,
//              sur la base d'un score composite a 5 leviers (dont am_expl
//              comme pont AM->PM) + 3 filtres extremes (VERT, ROUGE 18h20,
//              ROUGE FOMC) + 1 alerte tardive a 18h40 (sans alignement).
//
//              Les 5 leviers du score composite (evalues a 15h20) :
//                1a  pre_amp_pts     >= 240   +1   range pre-NY 14h00-15h20
//                1b  pre_net_pts     <= -110  +1   net pre-NY 14h00-15h20
//                3+  jeudi/vendredi          +1   levier calendaire
//                3-  lundi                    -1   le seul levier negatif
//                4   expl_count_5d   >= 2    +1   regime explosif recent
//                5   position_14d    <= 32%  +1   proche du plus bas 14j
//              Score total : -1 a +5.
//
//              Les 6 niveaux de risque (probabilites PDF v2) :
//                1  VERT 15h20      pre_amp<=130 ET expl_count_5d=0   P=0.0%
//                2  ROUGE 15h20     pre_amp>=280 ET on_amp/h>=30      P=90.9%
//                                   ET position_14d<=32
//                3  Orange-faible   score <= 0                         P=7.6%
//                4  Orange-moyen    score 1-2                          P=13.9%
//                5  Orange-eleve    score >= 3                         P=19.2%
//                6  ROUGE 15h40     orange ET b12_range >= 120 ET     P=88.9%
//                                   alignement B1+B2 (V1) — alerte
//                                   tardive declenchee au close B2
//
//              Les 4 phases temporelles :
//                Phase 1 (1h00-14h00)   : score "structurel", 3 leviers stables
//                                         (weekday, expl_count_5d, position_14d)
//                                         — fond gris, pre_amp/pre_net en "—"
//                Phase 2 (14h00-15h20) : score provisoire, pre_amp/pre_net
//                                        evoluent au fil des bougies M5
//                Phase 3 (15h20)        : verrouillage, classification figee
//                                         (Etat = verdict 15h20)
//                Phase 4 (15h40)        : alerte tardive eventuelle, orange ->
//                                         ROUGE 15h40 si b12_range >= 120
//                                         ET corps B1 et B2 dans le meme sens
//                                         (Etat ajuste = classification courante)
//
//              Reset journalier a 1h00 Paris (heure fixe, pas de pb de TZ) :
//              purge des verdicts de la veille avant que la phase structurelle
//              ne reprenne le calcul du score.
//
//              Greffon FVG inchange depuis v1.2 : repeint en jaune les bougies
//              au centre d'un "Fair Value Gap" (low[1]>high[3] ou high[1]<low[3]).
//
//              Dashboard en bas a droite, trois modes. Bascule visuelle a
//              18h00 Paris : avant 18h le panneau affiche les leviers AM,
//              apres 18h les leviers PM. Une ligne cross-session permet de
//              voir l'autre verdict de la journee (Etat AM fige sur le
//              panneau PM, Etat PM a venir sur le panneau AM).
//                - Masque    : pas d'affichage
//                - Complet   : 14 lignes. AM 3-col : Etat / Score / P(expl) /
//                              sep / 5 leviers / sep / b12 range / b12 align /
//                              Etat ajuste / Etat PM. PM 3-col : Etat AM /
//                              Etat PM / Score / P(expl) / sep / 6 leviers /
//                              sep / b12 range / Etat ajuste. Variante 2-col
//                              avec couleur des leviers indiquant validation.
//                - Simplifie : 5 lignes (titre / Etat session active /
//                              P(expl) / Etat ajuste / Etat autre session)
//              Padding configurable pour empiler avec un dashboard secondaire.
//
// Source statistique : "NQ Anticipation des explosions sur NY AM" (Mai 2026,
//                      340 jours · NQ M5 · 1 jan. 2025 - 8 mai 2026).
//                      Calibration : train 2025 / test 2026 (hold-out).
//
// Detection c2 (cf. PDF, Definitions) :
//   Une sequence de bougies M5 consecutives durant NY AM 15h30-17h30
//   constitue une "explosion >= 200 c2" si :
//     - |close_last - open_first| >= 200 pts
//     - au maximum 2 bougies contraires dans la sequence
//   Une bougie contraire est une bougie dont le corps va dans le sens
//   oppose au mouvement net (close<open si mouvement haussier, etc.).
//
//   Algorithme : pour chaque jour passe, on collecte les ~24 bougies M5
//   de la session AM, puis on cherche une paire (i,j) avec j>=i+2 telle que
//   le critere c2 est rempli. Si oui, le jour est marque "explose".
//
// Changelog:
//   v2.2.0 - 2026-05-12
//     - Extension : module Risk Assessment NY PM. Source PDF v4
//       "NQ Anticipation NY PM Score v4" (334 jours, recall ROUGES 51%).
//       Le module AM est inchange.
//     - Session PM 18h30-20h30 Paris : evaluation a 18h20, alerte tardive
//       a 18h40, fin de session a 20h30.
//     - Score composite PM a 5 leviers, plage 0-5 :
//         pre_pm_amp_pts   >= 140   +1   range pre-PM 17h20-18h20
//         pre_pm_net_pts   <= -100  +1   net pre-PM 17h20-18h20
//         am_expl == true           +1   l'AM du jour J a explose
//         expl_pm_count_5d >= 2     +1   regime explosif PM recent (seuil c2 150)
//         position_14d_pm  <= 30%   +1   proche du plus bas 14j a 18h20
//     - 7 niveaux de risque PM :
//         1  ROUGE FOMC     is_fomc == true (prioritaire)
//         2  VERT 18h20     pre_pm_amp <= 80 ET expl_pm_5d == 0
//         3  ROUGE 18h20    pre_pm_amp >= 140 ET pos_14d <= 30 ET am_expl
//         4  Orange-faible  score <= 0
//         5  Orange-moyen   score 1-2
//         6  Orange-eleve   score >= 3
//         7  ROUGE 18h40    orange ET b12_range_pm >= 80 (PAS d'alignement)
//     - Detection c2 PM avec seuil 150 pts (vs 200 AM), ring buffer
//       recent_pm_expl_days separe.
//     - am_expl_today : nouvelle variable persistante set a fire_ny_end,
//       lue par fire_pm_eval comme levier PM.
//     - Liste FOMC 2025-2026 codee en dur (16 dates). Extensible.
//     - Dashboard : bascule visuelle AM -> PM a 18h00 Paris. Trois modes
//       etendus (Complet 3-col, Complet 2-col, Simplifie), chacun avec
//       un layout PM dedie de 14 lignes. Rappel cross-session : ligne
//       "Etat AM" (fige) sur le panneau PM, ligne "Etat PM" (a venir)
//       sur le panneau AM.
//     - Layout PM optimise UX : libelle "Etat PM" explicite pour distinguer
//       du rappel cross-session "Etat AM", Etat AM et Etat PM sur lignes
//       adjacentes sans separateur, separateur ajoute avant b12 range pour
//       isoler la confirmation finale de l'alerte tardive.
//     - Module PM desactivable via input enable_pm_module (defaut on).
//       Si desactive, le dashboard se comporte exactement comme en v2.1.0.
//
//   v2.1.0 - 2026-05-12
//     - Evaluation deplacee de 15h30 a 15h20 (10 min avant ouverture NY AM).
//       Justification PDF v2 Section 4 : correlation pre_amp/pre_net a 0.98
//       entre 15h20 et 15h30, mais +10 min de preparation operationnelle,
//       +6 jours VERT (93 vs 87, toujours 0% explosion), precision combinee
//       ROUGE 90.0% vs 86.4%, alerte tardive 88.9% vs 80.0%.
//     - pre_amp/pre_net accumules sur 14h00-15h20 (16 bougies M5 au lieu de 18).
//     - on_amp_per_hour : duree de reference passee de 17.4167h a 17.25h
//       (overnight 22h05 J-1 -> 15h20 J = 17h15 min).
//     - position_14d : base sur l'open de la bougie 15h20-15h25 (au lieu de 15h30).
//     - Alerte tardive renommee 15h45 -> 15h40 (close de B2, instant inchange).
//     - Renommages classification : VERT/ROUGE 15h30 -> VERT/ROUGE 15h20,
//       ROUGE 15h45 -> ROUGE 15h40 ; var classification_15h30 -> _15h20,
//       constantes couleurs COL_CLASS_ROUGE_15h30/_15h45 -> _15h20/_15h40.
//     - Probabilites par classe mises a jour selon PDF v2 :
//       VERT 0.0% inchange, Orange-faible 8.1% -> 7.6%, Orange-moyen 12.0% ->
//       13.9%, Orange-eleve 19.4% -> 19.2%, ROUGE 15h40 72.7% -> 88.9%,
//       ROUGE 15h20 91.7% -> 90.9%.
//     - Push des bougies AM toujours a partir de 15h30 (ouverture NY reelle)
//       jusqu'a 17h30 -> detection c2 inchangee.
//
//   v2.0.2 - 2026-05-11
//     - Phase 1 (Structurel) reellement implementee. Avant cette version,
//       le dashboard affichait le verdict de la veille jusqu'a 14h00 ce qui
//       portait a confusion (fond colore avec une classe heritee).
//     - Nouveau trigger fire_daily_reset a 1h00 Paris (heure fixe pour
//       eviter les problemes de TZ liees aux sessions TV). A 1h00, tout
//       l'etat lie a la veille est purge : classification, classification_15h20,
//       pre_amp_pts, pre_net_pts, on_amp_*, b12_*, position_14d_pts,
//       expl_count_5d. Les structures persistantes (recent_expl_days,
//       am_*, on_active) ne sont pas touchees.
//     - Nouveau bloc score structurel actif entre 1h00 et 14h00 : recalcul
//       continu du score avec les 3 leviers stables (weekday, expl_count_5d,
//       position_14d estimee via close). Score range -1 a +3. La
//       classification reste 0 (fond gris) tant que le verdict 15h30 n'est
//       pas pose.
//     - Dashboard : label "Structurel" pour l'Etat entre 1h00 et 14h00,
//       puis "EN COURS" entre 14h00 et 15h30, puis classification finale.
//       Les leviers pre_amp et pre_net affichent "—" pendant la phase
//       structurelle.
//     - Fix helper f_paris_to_utc_min : wrap modulo 1440 quand le resultat
//       est negatif. Sans ce wrap, 01h00 Paris en CEST (ete) donnait
//       60 - 120 = -60, valeur jamais atteinte par utc_total in [0,1439],
//       et le trigger fire_daily_reset ne firait jamais en ete. Avec le
//       wrap, 01h00 Paris ete -> 23h00 UTC = 1380, atteignable.
//
//   v2.0.1 - 2026-05-11
//     - Fix : classification_15h30 etait reset uniquement a 15h30 et pas a
//       14h00, donc pendant la pre-NY le dashboard affichait le verdict de
//       la veille avec un fond gris (incoherent). Reset ajoute au trigger
//       pre-NY start.
//     - Alerte tardive 15h45 V1 : ajout d'une condition d'alignement
//       directionnel sur B1 et B2. L'alerte ne se declenche que si les
//       corps de B1 et B2 vont dans le meme sens, en plus du critere
//       b12_range >= 120. Filtre les faux positifs yo-yo (spike + retour).
//       Sur les 11 alertes V0, 1 faux positif filtre, 0 vrai positif perdu.
//       Precision : 72.7% (V0) -> 80.0% (V1).
//       Nouvel input "Alerte 15h45 : exiger l'alignement B1+B2"
//       (defaut on) pour pouvoir desactiver si regime de marche change.
//     - Dashboard Complet : 2 nouvelles lignes b12 range et b12 align
//       (avant Etat ajuste) pour visualiser le detail de la condition
//       d'alerte. Table passe de 11 a 13 lignes.
//
//   v2.0.0 - 2026-05-11
//     - REFONTE MAJEURE : remplacement integral du module statistique v1.x
//       (tables Timing 1/2/3, Section 3, ponderation log-odds) par le module
//       Risk Assessment base sur le score composite a 5 leviers + 2 filtres
//       extremes + alerte tardive 15h45.
//     - Detection exacte des explosions c2 (pas de proxy approximatif).
//     - 6 niveaux de risque avec couleurs de fond dediees (du vert au rouge).
//     - 4 phases d'affichage : structurel / provisoire / verrouille / ajuste.
//     - Dashboard refondu :
//       . Complet 3 colonnes (Label / Valeur / ✓✗+seuil), 11 lignes
//       . Complet 2 colonnes compact (Label / Valeur coloree par levier)
//       . Simplifie 2 colonnes x 4 lignes (titre / Etat / P(expl) / Etat ajuste)
//     - Etat (verdict 15h30) et Etat ajuste (apres alerte 15h45 eventuelle)
//       traites separement pour distinguer la classification initiale de
//       la classification finale.
//     - Conserves de v1.3.1 : header style, helpers DST, greffon FVG, palette
//       de couleurs (vert #3fb950, jaune #c99a2c, rouge #ff7b72, bleu),
//       structure dashboard (table transparente + padding configurable),
//       dropdown Mode d'affichage Masque/Complet/Simplifie.
//
//   v1.3.1 - 2026-05-05  (Dashboard simplifie : suppression prefixe Retr)
//   v1.3   - 2026-05-05  (Mode d'affichage dropdown + palette uniforme)
//   v1.2   - 2026-05-04  (FVG + dashboard bottom_right + padding)
//   v1.1   - 2026-05-04  (Section PM continuation / retracement a 17h30)
//   v1.0   - 2026-05-04  (Initial release - module statistique CAT1A/Timing)

//@version=6
indicator("JCO Directional Day", shorttitle="JCO Directional Day", overlay=true)

// ── Session NY AM ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
grp_sess = "Session NY AM"
ny_hour  = input.int(15, "Heure debut NY AM (Paris)", minval=0, maxval=23, group=grp_sess)
ny_min   = input.int(30, "Minute debut NY AM",         minval=0, maxval=59, group=grp_sess)

// ── Dashboard ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
grp_dash             = "Dashboard"
dash_mode            = input.string("Complet", "Mode d'affichage", options=["Masque", "Complet", "Simplifie"], group=grp_dash)
dash_show_thresholds = input.bool(true, "Afficher les seuils en 3e colonne, mode Complet", group=grp_dash, tooltip="Si decoche : passage a 2 colonnes, et la couleur de chaque levier indique sa validation (vert = active, gris = non active).")
dash_padding         = input.int(7, "Lignes vides en bas, reserve pour dashboard secondaire", minval=0, maxval=20, group=grp_dash)

// ── FVG (Fair Value Gap) ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
grp_fvg     = "FVG"
show_fvg    = input.bool(true,          "Afficher les bougies FVG",  group=grp_fvg)
fvg_color   = input.color(color.yellow, "Couleur du corps",          group=grp_fvg)
fvg_min_pts = input.int(1,              "Ecart minimum, en points",  minval=0, group=grp_fvg)

// ── Score composite ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
grp_score = "Score composite"
threshold_pre_amp_score = input.int(240,  "Seuil pre_amp pour +1 au score (pts)",                minval=0,  group=grp_score, tooltip="Range pre-NY 14h00-15h20. Levier 1a active si >= ce seuil.")
threshold_pre_net_score = input.int(-110, "Seuil pre_net pour +1 au score (pts, valeur negative)", maxval=0, group=grp_score, tooltip="Net pre-NY 14h00-15h20. Levier 1b active si <= ce seuil (baissier).")
threshold_expl_5d       = input.int(2,    "Nb explosions sur 5j pour +1 au score",               minval=0,  group=grp_score, tooltip="Levier 4 (regime explosif) active si expl_count_5d >= ce seuil.")
threshold_position_14d  = input.int(32,   "Position dans range 14j (%) pour +1 au score",        minval=0, maxval=100, group=grp_score, tooltip="Levier 5 (proximite plus bas 14j) active si position <= ce seuil.")

// ── Filtres extremes ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
grp_filters = "Filtres extremes"
threshold_vert_pre_amp    = input.int(130,    "Seuil pre_amp max pour filtre VERT (pts)",       minval=0,  group=grp_filters, tooltip="VERT 15h20 si pre_amp <= ce seuil ET expl_count_5d = 0.")
threshold_rouge_pre_amp   = input.int(280,    "Seuil pre_amp min pour filtre ROUGE 15h20 (pts)", minval=0, group=grp_filters)
threshold_rouge_on_amp_h  = input.float(30.0, "Seuil on_amp/h min pour ROUGE 15h20 (pts/heure)", minval=0,  group=grp_filters)
threshold_rouge_pos_14d   = input.int(32,     "Seuil position_14d max pour ROUGE 15h20 (%)",    minval=0, maxval=100, group=grp_filters)
threshold_rouge_15h40     = input.int(120,    "Seuil b12_range pour ROUGE 15h40 (pts)",         minval=0,  group=grp_filters, tooltip="Alerte tardive : si classification 15h20 etait Orange et b12_range (range des 2 premieres bougies AM) >= ce seuil, bascule en ROUGE 15h40.")
require_b12_alignment     = input.bool(true,  "Alerte 15h40 : exiger l'alignement B1+B2",       group=grp_filters, tooltip="V1 - Si vrai (recommande), l'alerte ne se declenche que si les corps de B1 et B2 vont dans le meme sens. Filtre les faux positifs yo-yo. Si faux, comportement V0 (range seul). Precision 88.9% vs 80% en V0 sur 2025-2026 (PDF v2).")

// ── Parametres techniques ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
grp_tech = "Techniques"
explosion_threshold_pts   = input.int(200, "Seuil pts pour detecter une explosion c2 AM",       minval=0, group=grp_tech, tooltip="|close_last - open_first| >= ce seuil sur la sequence AM.")
explosion_max_contraries  = input.int(2,   "Max bougies contraires dans une sequence c2",       minval=0, group=grp_tech)
position_window           = input.int(14,  "Fenetre du range structurel (jours)",                minval=1, group=grp_tech)
regime_window             = input.int(5,   "Fenetre du compteur d'explosions recentes (jours)", minval=1, group=grp_tech)

// ── Module PM (extension v2.2.0) ─────────────────────────────────────────────
grp_pm = "Module PM"
enable_pm_module          = input.bool(true, "Activer le module Risk Assessment NY PM",          group=grp_pm, tooltip="Si decoche, le dashboard se comporte exactement comme en v2.1.0 (AM seul, pas de bascule visuelle a 18h00).")
// Score composite PM (5 leviers, plage 0-5)
threshold_pre_pm_amp      = input.int(140,  "Seuil pre_pm_amp pour +1 au score PM (pts)",       minval=0,  group=grp_pm, tooltip="Range pre-PM 17h20-18h20. Levier active si >= ce seuil.")
threshold_pre_pm_net      = input.int(-100, "Seuil pre_pm_net pour +1 au score PM (pts, neg)",   maxval=0, group=grp_pm, tooltip="Net pre-PM 17h20-18h20. Levier active si <= ce seuil baissier.")
threshold_pm_expl_5d      = input.int(2,    "Nb explosions PM sur 5j pour +1 au score PM",       minval=0,  group=grp_pm, tooltip="Regime explosif PM, seuil c2 PM = 150 pts.")
threshold_pm_pos_14d      = input.int(30,   "Position dans range 14j (%) pour +1 au score PM",  minval=0, maxval=100, group=grp_pm, tooltip="Proximite plus bas 14j a 18h20. Levier active si <= ce seuil.")
// Filtres extremes PM
threshold_pm_vert_amp     = input.int(80,   "Seuil pre_pm_amp max pour filtre VERT PM (pts)",   minval=0,  group=grp_pm, tooltip="VERT 18h20 si pre_pm_amp <= ce seuil ET expl_pm_5d = 0.")
threshold_pm_rouge_amp    = input.int(140,  "Seuil pre_pm_amp min pour filtre ROUGE 18h20 (pts)", minval=0, group=grp_pm)
threshold_pm_rouge_pos    = input.int(30,   "Seuil position_14d_pm max pour ROUGE 18h20 (%)",   minval=0, maxval=100, group=grp_pm, tooltip="ROUGE 18h20 si pre_pm_amp >= seuil ET pos <= ce seuil ET am_expl == true.")
threshold_pm_rouge_18h40  = input.int(80,   "Seuil b12_range_pm pour ROUGE 18h40 (pts)",        minval=0,  group=grp_pm, tooltip="Alerte tardive PM : si Orange a 18h20 et b12_range_pm >= ce seuil, bascule en ROUGE 18h40. PAS d'alignement requis (difference vs AM).")
// Parametres techniques PM
pm_explosion_threshold    = input.int(150,  "Seuil pts pour explosion c2 PM",                    minval=0,  group=grp_pm, tooltip="Seuil specifique aux explosions PM, plus bas qu'en AM 200 pts.")

// ── Detection heure d'ete Paris (CEST = GMT+2) ───────────────────────────────
// Dernier dimanche de mars -> dernier dimanche d'octobre
f_is_cest(t) =>
    m   = month(t, "UTC")
    d   = dayofmonth(t, "UTC")
    dow = dayofweek(t, "UTC")
    days_in_month = m == 2 ? (year(t,"UTC") % 4 == 0 ? 29 : 28) : (m == 4 or m == 6 or m == 9 or m == 11 ? 30 : 31)
    last_sun_of_month = days_in_month - (dow - 1 + 7) % 7
    last_sun_of_month := last_sun_of_month > days_in_month ? last_sun_of_month - 7 : last_sun_of_month
    if m > 3 and m < 10
        true
    else if m == 3
        d >= last_sun_of_month
    else if m == 10
        d < last_sun_of_month
    else
        false

// Heure (en minutes UTC) d'un horaire Paris donne, gere le DST
// Wrap modulo 1440 pour les horaires Paris < offset DST (ex: 01h00 Paris en ete = 23h00 UTC jour precedent)
f_paris_to_utc_min(t, paris_total_min) =>
    paris_offset_h = f_is_cest(t) ? 2 : 1
    raw = paris_total_min - paris_offset_h * 60
    raw < 0 ? raw + 1440 : raw

// ── Dates FOMC 2025-2026, levier prioritaire du module PM ────────────────────
// Format YYYY-MM-DD pour matching direct contre day_id_str.
// Etendre au fur et a mesure, source : calendrier FOMC officiel.
var array<string> fomc_dates = array.from("2025-01-29", "2025-03-19", "2025-05-07", "2025-06-18", "2025-07-30", "2025-09-17", "2025-10-29", "2025-12-10", "2026-01-28", "2026-03-18", "2026-04-29", "2026-06-17", "2026-07-29", "2026-09-16", "2026-10-28", "2026-12-09")

// Test : la date Paris du bar courant correspond-elle a un FOMC ?
f_is_fomc(y, m, d) =>
    s = str.tostring(y) + "-" + (m < 10 ? "0" : "") + str.tostring(m) + "-" + (d < 10 ? "0" : "") + str.tostring(d)
    array.includes(fomc_dates, s)

// ── Palette de couleurs ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Reprise de v1.3 : couleurs uniformes avec l'indicateur JCO NY Amplitude Levels
COL_GREEN  = #3fb950
COL_YELLOW = #c99a2c
COL_RED    = #ff7b72
COL_BLUE   = color.blue
COL_GRAY   = color.gray
DASH_BG    = color.new(color.gray, 85)   // fond gris semi-transparent par defaut

// Couleurs des 6 niveaux de classification (de l'etude, page 10 du PDF)
// Border : couleur forte pour le texte de l'etat ; Bg : version transparente pour le fond
COL_CLASS_VERT       = #1D9E75
COL_CLASS_O_FAIBLE   = #7DB249
COL_CLASS_O_MOYEN    = #C8A437
COL_CLASS_O_ELEVE    = #E89B2D
COL_CLASS_ROUGE_15h40 = #D67340   // alerte tardive
COL_CLASS_ROUGE_15h20 = #D24545

// Couleurs des 7 niveaux de classification PM, palette graduee (PDF v4)
// PM utilise les memes 3 oranges que l'AM pour coherence inter-session.
COL_CLASS_PM_VERT        = COL_CLASS_VERT
COL_CLASS_PM_O_FAIBLE    = COL_CLASS_O_FAIBLE
COL_CLASS_PM_O_MOYEN     = COL_CLASS_O_MOYEN
COL_CLASS_PM_O_ELEVE     = COL_CLASS_O_ELEVE
COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_18h40 = #D67340   // alerte tardive PM
COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_18h20 = #D24545
COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_FOMC  = #8B1A1A   // rouge fonce, FOMC = niveau le plus eleve

// ── Helpers de formatage et de labelling ─────────────────────────────────────
// Labels de classification. Les 3 niveaux Orange sont scindes sur 2 lignes
// (Orange / faible|moyen|eleve) pour gagner en largeur dans le dashboard.
f_class_text(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => "VERT 15h20"
        2 => "ROUGE 15h20"
        3 => "Orange\nfaible"
        4 => "Orange\nmoyen"
        5 => "Orange\neleve"
        6 => "ROUGE 15h40"
        => "—"

// Version courte sans suffixe horaire. Utilisee pour la ligne "Etat ajuste"
// afin d'eviter la confusion durant les semaines de transition DST ou les
// horaires d'ouverture NY decalent par rapport au libelle.
f_class_text_short(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => "VERT"
        2 => "ROUGE"
        3 => "Orange\nfaible"
        4 => "Orange\nmoyen"
        5 => "Orange\neleve"
        6 => "ROUGE"
        => "—"

f_class_color(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => COL_CLASS_VERT
        2 => COL_CLASS_ROUGE_15h20
        3 => COL_CLASS_O_FAIBLE
        4 => COL_CLASS_O_MOYEN
        5 => COL_CLASS_O_ELEVE
        6 => COL_CLASS_ROUGE_15h40
        => COL_GRAY

f_class_bg(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => color.new(COL_CLASS_VERT,        85)
        2 => color.new(COL_CLASS_ROUGE_15h20, 80)
        3 => color.new(COL_CLASS_O_FAIBLE,    85)
        4 => color.new(COL_CLASS_O_MOYEN,     85)
        5 => color.new(COL_CLASS_O_ELEVE,     82)
        6 => color.new(COL_CLASS_ROUGE_15h40, 80)
        => DASH_BG

f_class_pexpl(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => 0.0
        2 => 90.9
        3 => 7.6
        4 => 13.9
        5 => 19.2
        6 => 88.9
        => na

// ── Helpers de labelling PM, 7 niveaux ───────────────────────────────────────
// Mapping : 1=VERT 18h20, 2=ROUGE 18h20, 3-4-5=Orange faible/moyen/eleve,
//           6=ROUGE 18h40, 7=ROUGE FOMC.
f_class_pm_text(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => "VERT 18h20"
        2 => "ROUGE 18h20"
        3 => "Orange\nfaible"
        4 => "Orange\nmoyen"
        5 => "Orange\neleve"
        6 => "ROUGE 18h40"
        7 => "ROUGE FOMC"
        => "—"

f_class_pm_text_short(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => "VERT"
        2 => "ROUGE"
        3 => "Orange\nfaible"
        4 => "Orange\nmoyen"
        5 => "Orange\neleve"
        6 => "ROUGE"
        7 => "ROUGE\nFOMC"
        => "—"

f_class_pm_color(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => COL_CLASS_PM_VERT
        2 => COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_18h20
        3 => COL_CLASS_PM_O_FAIBLE
        4 => COL_CLASS_PM_O_MOYEN
        5 => COL_CLASS_PM_O_ELEVE
        6 => COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_18h40
        7 => COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_FOMC
        => COL_GRAY

f_class_pm_bg(c) =>
    switch c
        1 => color.new(COL_CLASS_PM_VERT,         85)
        2 => color.new(COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_18h20,  80)
        3 => color.new(COL_CLASS_PM_O_FAIBLE,     85)
        4 => color.new(COL_CLASS_PM_O_MOYEN,      85)
        5 => color.new(COL_CLASS_PM_O_ELEVE,      82)
        6 => color.new(COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_18h40,  80)
        7 => color.new(COL_CLASS_PM_ROUGE_FOMC,   75)
        => DASH_BG

// Probabilites d'explosion par classe PM (PDF v4 Section 6, valeurs a affiner).
// Pour les classes sans valeur calibree fournie, retourne na (affiche "—").
f_class_pm_pexpl(c) =>
    switch c
        4 => 20.0   // Orange moyen, valeur du mockup PDF v4
        => na

f_weekday_name(d) =>
    d == 2 ? "Lundi" : d == 3 ? "Mardi" : d == 4 ? "Mercredi" : d == 5 ? "Jeudi" : d == 6 ? "Vendredi" : "Week-end"

// Effet du jour de la semaine sur le score : jeudi/vendredi +1, lundi -1, sinon 0
f_weekday_lever(d) =>
    d == 5 or d == 6 ? 1 : d == 2 ? -1 : 0

// Format integer
f_fmt_i(x) =>
    na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(math.round(x))

// Format en points
f_fmt_pts(x) =>
    na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(math.round(x)) + " pts"

// Format pourcentage (1 decimale)
f_fmt_pct1(x) =>
    na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(math.round(x * 10) / 10.0, "0.0") + "%"

// Format float (1 decimale)
f_fmt_f1(x) =>
    na(x) ? "—" : str.tostring(math.round(x * 10) / 10.0, "0.0")

// Marqueur visuel d'activation d'un levier
f_check_mark(b) =>
    b ? "✓" : "✗"

// Format signe : +1 / -1 / 0
f_fmt_signed(x) =>
    x > 0 ? "+" + str.tostring(x) : str.tostring(x)

// Fleche de direction d'un corps de bougie : haussiere / baissiere / doji
f_dir_arrow(d) =>
    d > 0 ? "↑" : d < 0 ? "↓" : "·"

// ── Detection d'explosion c2 (cf. PDF, definition stricte) ───────────────────
// Cherche une paire (i, j) de bougies M5 avec j >= i+2 telle que
// |close[j] - open[i]| >= threshold et au plus max_contr bougies contraires
// dans la sequence [i..j]. Retourne true des qu'une explosion est trouvee.
//
// Complexite O(n^3) dans le pire cas. Pour n=24 (session AM), ~14k operations
// au maximum, mais executee une seule fois par jour a 17h30 -> negligeable.
f_detect_explosion_c2(o, h, l, c, threshold, max_contr) =>
    int n = array.size(o)
    bool explosed = false
    // Attention : Pine v6 auto-inverse les bornes quand from > to (step
    // implicite -1). On doit donc borner i a n-3 pour eviter que j = i+2
    // depasse n-1 (qui declencherait un index out of bounds via auto-reverse).
    if n >= 3
        for i = 0 to n - 3
            if not explosed
                for j = i + 2 to n - 1
                    if not explosed
                        mvt = array.get(c, j) - array.get(o, i)
                        if math.abs(mvt) >= threshold
                            sign = mvt > 0 ? 1 : -1
                            int contr = 0
                            for k = i to j
                                body = array.get(c, k) - array.get(o, k)
                                if (sign > 0 and body < 0) or (sign < 0 and body > 0)
                                    contr += 1
                            if contr <= max_contr
                                explosed := true
    explosed

// ── Calcul des horaires UTC (selon DST) ──────────────────────────────────────
// Toutes les bornes sont definies en heure Paris puis converties en UTC.
// Note : ny_open reste l'instant reel d'ouverture NY 15h30, pour la collecte
// des bougies AM. L'evaluation du score, verrouillage, se fait a eval 15h20.
daily_reset_paris   = 60                         // 60 = 01h00 Paris, reset journalier
ny_total_min        = ny_hour * 60 + ny_min      // 930 = 15h30 Paris, ouverture NY reelle
eval_paris          = ny_total_min - 10          // 920 = 15h20 Paris, instant d'evaluation PDF v2
pre_ny_start_paris  = 14 * 60                    // 840 = 14h00 Paris
b2_close_paris      = ny_total_min + 10          // 940 = 15h40 Paris, B2 vient de fermer
ny_end_paris        = ny_total_min + 120         // 1050 = 17h30 Paris
overnight_start_par = 22 * 60 + 5                // 1325 = 22h05 Paris

daily_reset_utc     = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, daily_reset_paris)
pre_ny_start_utc    = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, pre_ny_start_paris)
eval_utc            = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, eval_paris)
ny_open_utc         = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, ny_total_min)
b2_close_utc        = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, b2_close_paris)
ny_end_utc          = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, ny_end_paris)
overnight_start_utc = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, overnight_start_par)

// ── Horaires PM (module v2.2.0) ──────────────────────────────────────────────
pre_pm_start_paris  = 17 * 60 + 20               // 1040 = 17h20 Paris, debut accumulation pre-PM
am_pm_switch_paris  = 18 * 60                    // 1080 = 18h00 Paris, bascule visuelle dashboard
pm_eval_paris       = 18 * 60 + 20               // 1100 = 18h20 Paris, evaluation PM PDF v4
pm_open_paris       = 18 * 60 + 30               // 1110 = 18h30 Paris, ouverture session PM reelle
pm_b2_close_paris   = 18 * 60 + 40               // 1120 = 18h40 Paris, B2 PM vient de fermer
pm_end_paris        = 20 * 60 + 30               // 1230 = 20h30 Paris, fin session PM

pre_pm_start_utc    = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, pre_pm_start_paris)
am_pm_switch_utc    = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, am_pm_switch_paris)
pm_eval_utc         = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, pm_eval_paris)
pm_open_utc         = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, pm_open_paris)
pm_b2_close_utc     = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, pm_b2_close_paris)
pm_end_utc          = f_paris_to_utc_min(time, pm_end_paris)

utc_h     = hour(time, "UTC")
utc_m     = minute(time, "UTC")
utc_total = utc_h * 60 + utc_m

// Day tracking Paris : un day_id stable par jour calendaire Paris
// Construit comme year*10000 + month*100 + dayofmonth, unique et sortable.
paris_year  = year(time, "Europe/Paris")
paris_month = month(time, "Europe/Paris")
paris_dom   = dayofmonth(time, "Europe/Paris")
day_id  = paris_year * 10000 + paris_month * 100 + paris_dom
weekday = dayofweek(time, "Europe/Paris")   // Pine v6 : 1=Dim, 2=Lun, ..., 6=Ven, 7=Sam

// ── Range structurel 14 jours via daily timeframe ────────────────────────────
// On recupere les highs/lows des 14 jours precedents (exclu aujourd'hui via [1])
// depuis le timeframe Daily, malgre qu'on tourne sur M5.
high_14d = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", ta.highest(high[1], position_window))
low_14d  = request.security(syminfo.tickerid, "D", ta.lowest(low[1],  position_window))

// ── Etat persistant ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Accumulateur pre-NY (14h00 -> 15h25)
var float pre_h = na
var float pre_l = na
var float pre_o = na
var float pre_c = na
var bool  pre_active = false
var int   pre_ny_day = -1

// Snapshot pre-NY, final a 15h20
var float pre_amp_pts = na
var float pre_net_pts = na

// Accumulateur overnight 22h05 J-1 -> 15h20 J, traverse minuit
var float on_h = na
var float on_l = na
var bool  on_active = false
var int   on_start_day = -1

// Snapshot overnight, final a 15h20
var float on_amp_pts = na
var float on_amp_per_hour = na

// Storage des bougies AM 15h30 -> 17h25, ~24 bougies M5
var array<float> am_opens  = array.new<float>(0)
var array<float> am_highs  = array.new<float>(0)
var array<float> am_lows   = array.new<float>(0)
var array<float> am_closes = array.new<float>(0)

// Snapshot eval, 15h20
var float eval_value     = na
var float position_14d_pts  = na
var int   eval_day       = -1
var int   expl_count_5d     = 0

// Snapshot 15h40, B2 fermee -> alerte tardive eventuelle
var float b12_range = na
var int   b1_dir = 0       // direction du corps B1 : +1 haussier, -1 baissier, 0 doji
var int   b2_dir = 0       // direction du corps B2
var bool  b12_aligned = false  // true si B1 et B2 vont dans le meme sens, hors doji
var int   b2_close_day = -1

// Detection c2 a 17h30 -> push dans l'historique des 5 derniers jours
var array<bool> recent_expl_days = array.new<bool>(0)
var int   ny_end_day = -1

// Score & classification
var int  score          = 0      // -1 a +5
var int  classification = 0      // 0 = pas encore calcule, 1-6 = niveaux, peut basculer en 6 a 15h40
var int  classification_15h20 = 0  // classification figee a 15h20, AVANT alerte tardive eventuelle
var bool score_locked   = false  // true apres 15h20, false pendant pre-NY

// Reset journalier a 1h00 Paris : tracker du jour ou le reset a deja fire
var int  daily_reset_day = -1

// Reset de la classification a 14h00 pour signaler "EN COURS"
// La classification finale n'est etablie qu'a 15h20.

// === DEBUT MODULE PM RISK ASSESSMENT v4 ============================================
// Etat persistant specifique au module PM. Tout l'etat AM ci-dessus reste intact.

// am_expl_today : booleen, l'AM du jour J a-t-il explose ?
// Set a fire_ny_end (17h30) en meme temps que le push dans recent_expl_days.
// Utilise comme levier par fire_pm_eval (18h20). Reset a fire_daily_reset.
var bool am_expl_today = false

// Accumulateur pre-PM 17h20 -> 18h20
var float pre_pm_h = na
var float pre_pm_l = na
var float pre_pm_o = na
var float pre_pm_c = na
var bool  pre_pm_active = false
var int   pre_pm_day = -1

// Snapshot pre-PM, final a 18h20
var float pre_pm_amp_pts = na
var float pre_pm_net_pts = na

// Storage des bougies PM 18h30 -> 20h25, ~24 bougies M5
var array<float> pm_opens  = array.new<float>(0)
var array<float> pm_highs  = array.new<float>(0)
var array<float> pm_lows   = array.new<float>(0)
var array<float> pm_closes = array.new<float>(0)

// Snapshot eval PM, 18h20
var float pm_eval_value      = na
var float position_14d_pm_pts = na
var int   pm_eval_day        = -1
var int   expl_pm_count_5d   = 0
var bool  is_fomc_today      = false

// Snapshot 18h40, B2 PM fermee -> alerte tardive eventuelle
var float pm_b12_range = na
var int   pm_b1_dir = 0
var int   pm_b2_dir = 0
var int   pm_b2_close_day = -1

// Detection c2 PM a 20h30 -> push dans l'historique des 5 derniers jours PM
var array<bool> recent_pm_expl_days = array.new<bool>(0)
var int   pm_end_day = -1

// Score & classification PM
var int  pm_score              = 0   // 0 a +5
var int  classification_pm     = 0   // 0 = pas encore calcule, 1-7 = niveaux
var int  classification_pm_18h20 = 0 // figee a 18h20, AVANT alerte tardive
var bool pm_score_locked       = false

// === FIN MODULE PM RISK ASSESSMENT v4 ============================================

// ── Trigger 0 : reset journalier (1h00 Paris) ───────────────────────────────
// Purge tous les verdicts et donnees de la veille, sauf les structures qui
// doivent persister : recent_expl_days, am_*, on_active. La phase
// structurelle (1h00 -> 14h00) reprendra ensuite le calcul du score.
fire_daily_reset = utc_total == daily_reset_utc and day_id != daily_reset_day
if fire_daily_reset
    daily_reset_day := day_id
    classification := 0
    classification_15h20 := 0
    score_locked := false
    pre_amp_pts := na
    pre_net_pts := na
    on_amp_pts := na
    on_amp_per_hour := na
    b12_range := na
    b1_dir := 0
    b2_dir := 0
    b12_aligned := false
    position_14d_pts := na
    expl_count_5d := 0
    // Reset des variables PM, meme principe que pour l'AM
    am_expl_today := false
    pre_pm_amp_pts := na
    pre_pm_net_pts := na
    position_14d_pm_pts := na
    expl_pm_count_5d := 0
    is_fomc_today := false
    pm_b12_range := na
    pm_b1_dir := 0
    pm_b2_dir := 0
    classification_pm := 0
    classification_pm_18h20 := 0
    pm_score := 0
    pm_score_locked := false

// ── Trigger 1 : pre-NY start (14h00 Paris) ──────────────────────────────────
fire_pre_ny_start = utc_total == pre_ny_start_utc and day_id != pre_ny_day
if fire_pre_ny_start
    pre_ny_day := day_id
    pre_active := true
    pre_h := high
    pre_l := low
    pre_o := open
    pre_c := close
    // Reset des classifications : on entre en phase "EN COURS"
    // classification et classification_15h20 doivent etre remises a zero
    // sinon le dashboard affiche encore le verdict de la veille pendant
    // la pre-NY (texte de l'ancienne classe avec un BG gris -> incoherent).
    classification := 0
    classification_15h20 := 0
    score_locked := false

// Accumulation pre-NY pendant 14h00-15h20 exclu, soit 16 bougies M5 14h00..15h15
if pre_active and not fire_pre_ny_start and utc_total >= pre_ny_start_utc and utc_total < eval_utc and day_id == pre_ny_day
    pre_h := math.max(pre_h, high)
    pre_l := math.min(pre_l, low)
    pre_c := close

// ── Trigger 2 : overnight start (22h05 Paris) ───────────────────────────────
fire_overnight_start = utc_total == overnight_start_utc and day_id != on_start_day
if fire_overnight_start
    on_start_day := day_id
    on_active := true
    on_h := high
    on_l := low

// Accumulation overnight jusqu'a 15h20 inclus, stoppe au snapshot eval
if on_active and not fire_overnight_start
    on_h := math.max(on_h, high)
    on_l := math.min(on_l, low)

// ── Push des bougies AM (15h35 -> 17h30) ────────────────────────────────────
// On push la donnee de la bougie PRECEDENTE (bar[1]) car elle est confirmee.
// Sur 24 bougies AM (15h30 -> 17h25), cela fait 24 push pendant les bars
// 15h35 -> 17h30 (inclus).
push_am = utc_total > ny_open_utc and utc_total <= ny_end_utc and day_id == eval_day
if push_am
    array.push(am_opens,  open[1])
    array.push(am_highs,  high[1])
    array.push(am_lows,   low[1])
    array.push(am_closes, close[1])

// ── Trigger 3 : evaluation 15h20 — calcul final & classification ────────────
fire_eval_time = utc_total == eval_utc and day_id != eval_day
if fire_eval_time
    eval_day := day_id

    // Snapshot pre-NY 14h00-15h20 : range et net cumules sur 16 bougies M5
    pre_amp_pts := pre_active ? pre_h - pre_l : na
    pre_net_pts := pre_active ? pre_c - pre_o : na
    pre_active := false

    // Snapshot overnight 22h05 J-1 -> 15h20 J : range et pts par heure
    // Duree fixe : 17h15 = 17.25 heures
    on_amp_pts := on_active ? on_h - on_l : na
    on_amp_per_hour := not na(on_amp_pts) ? on_amp_pts / 17.25 : na
    on_active := false

    // Snapshot eval value et position dans le range 14 jours
    // open de la bougie 15h20-15h25, prix de reference pour position_14d
    eval_value := open
    range_14d_now = high_14d - low_14d
    position_14d_pts := range_14d_now > 0 ? (eval_value - low_14d) / range_14d_now * 100 : 50.0

    // Compter les explosions parmi les jours dans recent_expl_days
    int count = 0
    if array.size(recent_expl_days) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(recent_expl_days) - 1
            if array.get(recent_expl_days, i)
                count += 1
    expl_count_5d := count

    // Calcul du score composite final
    int s = 0
    if not na(pre_amp_pts) and pre_amp_pts >= threshold_pre_amp_score
        s += 1
    if not na(pre_net_pts) and pre_net_pts <= threshold_pre_net_score
        s += 1
    s += f_weekday_lever(weekday)
    if expl_count_5d >= threshold_expl_5d
        s += 1
    if not na(position_14d_pts) and position_14d_pts <= threshold_position_14d
        s += 1
    score := s

    // Classification : filtres extremes d'abord, puis bandes du score
    int c = 0
    if not na(pre_amp_pts) and pre_amp_pts <= threshold_vert_pre_amp and expl_count_5d == 0
        c := 1   // VERT 15h20
    else if not na(pre_amp_pts) and not na(on_amp_per_hour) and not na(position_14d_pts) and pre_amp_pts >= threshold_rouge_pre_amp and on_amp_per_hour >= threshold_rouge_on_amp_h and position_14d_pts <= threshold_rouge_pos_14d
        c := 2   // ROUGE 15h20
    else if score <= 0
        c := 3   // Orange-faible
    else if score <= 2
        c := 4   // Orange-moyen
    else
        c := 5   // Orange-eleve
    classification := c
    classification_15h20 := c  // copie figee, ne sera PAS modifiee par l'alerte 15h40
    score_locked := true

    // Reset du storage AM pour la nouvelle journee
    array.clear(am_opens)
    array.clear(am_highs)
    array.clear(am_lows)
    array.clear(am_closes)

// ── Trigger 4 : B2 close (15h40) — alerte tardive eventuelle ────────────────
fire_b2_close = utc_total == b2_close_utc and day_id != b2_close_day and day_id == eval_day
if fire_b2_close
    b2_close_day := day_id
    // B1 = bougie 15h30-15h35 (bar[2] sur le 15h40)
    // B2 = bougie 15h35-15h40 (bar[1] sur le 15h40)
    b1_h = high[2]
    b1_l = low[2]
    b2_h = high[1]
    b2_l = low[1]
    b12_range := math.max(b1_h, b2_h) - math.min(b1_l, b2_l)

    // V1 : direction du corps de chaque bougie + alignement
    // Filtre les faux positifs yo-yo type "spike + retour" (B1 et B2 en opposition).
    body_b1 = close[2] - open[2]
    body_b2 = close[1] - open[1]
    b1_dir := body_b1 > 0 ? 1 : body_b1 < 0 ? -1 : 0
    b2_dir := body_b2 > 0 ? 1 : body_b2 < 0 ? -1 : 0
    b12_aligned := b1_dir == b2_dir and b1_dir != 0

    // Bascule ROUGE 15h40 si classification etait Orange 3/4/5,
    // b12_range >= seuil, et alignement OK si require_b12_alignment.
    range_ok = b12_range >= threshold_rouge_15h40
    align_ok = not require_b12_alignment or b12_aligned
    if (classification == 3 or classification == 4 or classification == 5) and range_ok and align_ok
        classification := 6   // ROUGE 15h40

// ── Trigger 5 : NY end (17h30) — detection c2 + push historique ─────────────
fire_ny_end = utc_total == ny_end_utc and day_id != ny_end_day and day_id == eval_day
if fire_ny_end
    ny_end_day := day_id
    // push_am vient de pusher la derniere bougie (17h25) sur ce meme bar
    // -> am_* arrays contiennent 24 bougies AM
    explosed_today = f_detect_explosion_c2(am_opens, am_highs, am_lows, am_closes, explosion_threshold_pts, explosion_max_contraries)
    array.push(recent_expl_days, explosed_today)
    while array.size(recent_expl_days) > regime_window
        array.shift(recent_expl_days)
    // Exposer au module PM le verdict c2 AM du jour, levier de pm_eval a 18h20
    am_expl_today := explosed_today

// === DEBUT MODULE PM RISK ASSESSMENT v4 ============================================
// Triggers et calculs PM. Tout ce bloc est gate par enable_pm_module pour que
// les calculs ne tournent meme pas en idle si le module est desactive.

// ── Trigger PM-1 : pre-PM start (17h20 Paris) ───────────────────────────────
fire_pre_pm_start = enable_pm_module and utc_total == pre_pm_start_utc and day_id != pre_pm_day
if fire_pre_pm_start
    pre_pm_day := day_id
    pre_pm_active := true
    pre_pm_h := high
    pre_pm_l := low
    pre_pm_o := open
    pre_pm_c := close
    // Reset des classifications PM, on entre en phase pre-PM
    classification_pm := 0
    classification_pm_18h20 := 0
    pm_score_locked := false

// Accumulation pre-PM 17h20 -> 18h20 exclu, soit 12 bougies M5 17h20..18h15
if enable_pm_module and pre_pm_active and not fire_pre_pm_start and utc_total >= pre_pm_start_utc and utc_total < pm_eval_utc and day_id == pre_pm_day
    pre_pm_h := math.max(pre_pm_h, high)
    pre_pm_l := math.min(pre_pm_l, low)
    pre_pm_c := close

// ── Trigger PM-2 : evaluation PM 18h20 — calcul final & classification ──────
fire_pm_eval = enable_pm_module and utc_total == pm_eval_utc and day_id != pm_eval_day
if fire_pm_eval
    pm_eval_day := day_id

    // Snapshot pre-PM 17h20-18h20 : range et net cumules
    pre_pm_amp_pts := pre_pm_active ? pre_pm_h - pre_pm_l : na
    pre_pm_net_pts := pre_pm_active ? pre_pm_c - pre_pm_o : na
    pre_pm_active := false

    // Snapshot eval PM value et position dans le range 14 jours, base sur l'open
    // de la bougie 18h20-18h25 (= prix a 18h20 pile)
    pm_eval_value := open
    range_14d_now_pm = high_14d - low_14d
    position_14d_pm_pts := range_14d_now_pm > 0 ? (pm_eval_value - low_14d) / range_14d_now_pm * 100 : 50.0

    // FOMC : test sur la date Paris du jour
    is_fomc_today := f_is_fomc(paris_year, paris_month, paris_dom)

    // Comptage des explosions PM dans la fenetre 5 jours
    int pm_count = 0
    if array.size(recent_pm_expl_days) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(recent_pm_expl_days) - 1
            if array.get(recent_pm_expl_days, i)
                pm_count += 1
    expl_pm_count_5d := pm_count

    // Score composite PM, 5 leviers, plage 0-5
    int sp = 0
    if not na(pre_pm_amp_pts) and pre_pm_amp_pts >= threshold_pre_pm_amp
        sp += 1
    if not na(pre_pm_net_pts) and pre_pm_net_pts <= threshold_pre_pm_net
        sp += 1
    if am_expl_today
        sp += 1
    if expl_pm_count_5d >= threshold_pm_expl_5d
        sp += 1
    if not na(position_14d_pm_pts) and position_14d_pm_pts <= threshold_pm_pos_14d
        sp += 1
    pm_score := sp

    // Classification PM : FOMC prioritaire, puis VERT, puis ROUGE 18h20,
    // puis bandes du score.
    int cp = 0
    if is_fomc_today
        cp := 7   // ROUGE FOMC, prioritaire sur tout
    else if not na(pre_pm_amp_pts) and pre_pm_amp_pts <= threshold_pm_vert_amp and expl_pm_count_5d == 0
        cp := 1   // VERT 18h20
    else if not na(pre_pm_amp_pts) and not na(position_14d_pm_pts) and pre_pm_amp_pts >= threshold_pm_rouge_amp and position_14d_pm_pts <= threshold_pm_rouge_pos and am_expl_today
        cp := 2   // ROUGE 18h20
    else if pm_score <= 0
        cp := 3   // Orange-faible
    else if pm_score <= 2
        cp := 4   // Orange-moyen
    else
        cp := 5   // Orange-eleve
    classification_pm := cp
    classification_pm_18h20 := cp  // copie figee, ne sera PAS modifiee par l'alerte 18h40
    pm_score_locked := true

    // Reset du storage PM pour la nouvelle session
    array.clear(pm_opens)
    array.clear(pm_highs)
    array.clear(pm_lows)
    array.clear(pm_closes)

// ── Push des bougies PM (18h35 -> 20h30) ────────────────────────────────────
// On push la donnee de la bougie PRECEDENTE (bar[1]) car elle est confirmee.
push_pm = enable_pm_module and utc_total > pm_open_utc and utc_total <= pm_end_utc and day_id == pm_eval_day
if push_pm
    array.push(pm_opens,  open[1])
    array.push(pm_highs,  high[1])
    array.push(pm_lows,   low[1])
    array.push(pm_closes, close[1])

// ── Trigger PM-3 : B2 PM close (18h40) — alerte tardive eventuelle ──────────
fire_pm_b2_close = enable_pm_module and utc_total == pm_b2_close_utc and day_id != pm_b2_close_day and day_id == pm_eval_day
if fire_pm_b2_close
    pm_b2_close_day := day_id
    // B1 PM = bougie 18h30-18h35 (bar[2] sur le 18h40)
    // B2 PM = bougie 18h35-18h40 (bar[1] sur le 18h40)
    pmb1_h = high[2]
    pmb1_l = low[2]
    pmb2_h = high[1]
    pmb2_l = low[1]
    pm_b12_range := math.max(pmb1_h, pmb2_h) - math.min(pmb1_l, pmb2_l)

    // Direction des corps B1/B2 pour affichage (pas de filtre alignement en PM)
    body_pmb1 = close[2] - open[2]
    body_pmb2 = close[1] - open[1]
    pm_b1_dir := body_pmb1 > 0 ? 1 : body_pmb1 < 0 ? -1 : 0
    pm_b2_dir := body_pmb2 > 0 ? 1 : body_pmb2 < 0 ? -1 : 0

    // Bascule ROUGE 18h40 si classification etait Orange 3/4/5 et range >= seuil.
    // PAS de condition d'alignement, difference cle vs AM PDF v4 Section 5.
    pm_range_ok = pm_b12_range >= threshold_pm_rouge_18h40
    if (classification_pm == 3 or classification_pm == 4 or classification_pm == 5) and pm_range_ok
        classification_pm := 6   // ROUGE 18h40

// ── Trigger PM-4 : PM end (20h30) — detection c2 + push historique ──────────
fire_pm_end = enable_pm_module and utc_total == pm_end_utc and day_id != pm_end_day and day_id == pm_eval_day
if fire_pm_end
    pm_end_day := day_id
    pm_explosed_today = f_detect_explosion_c2(pm_opens, pm_highs, pm_lows, pm_closes, pm_explosion_threshold, explosion_max_contraries)
    array.push(recent_pm_expl_days, pm_explosed_today)
    while array.size(recent_pm_expl_days) > regime_window
        array.shift(recent_pm_expl_days)

// === FIN MODULE PM RISK ASSESSMENT v4 ============================================

// ── Score provisoire pendant la pre-NY 14h00 -> 15h20 ───────────────────────
// On recalcule a chaque bougie avec les valeurs partielles de pre_amp/pre_net
// pour l'affichage en temps reel. Le score "structurel" avant 14h00 utilise
// seulement les 3 leviers stables : weekday, expl_count_5d, position_14d.
in_pre_ny_window = pre_active and utc_total >= pre_ny_start_utc and utc_total < eval_utc and day_id == pre_ny_day
if in_pre_ny_window
    // Valeurs partielles, recalcule sur chaque bougie y compris le bar 14h00
    // ou pre_h/l/o/c viennent juste d'etre initialises par fire_pre_ny_start.
    prov_pre_amp = pre_h - pre_l
    prov_pre_net = pre_c - pre_o
    // Position 14d estimee avec le close courant
    range_14d_now = high_14d - low_14d
    prov_pos_14d = range_14d_now > 0 ? (close - low_14d) / range_14d_now * 100 : 50.0
    // Comptage explosions
    int prov_count = 0
    if array.size(recent_expl_days) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(recent_expl_days) - 1
            if array.get(recent_expl_days, i)
                prov_count += 1
    expl_count_5d := prov_count
    // Score provisoire
    int s = 0
    if prov_pre_amp >= threshold_pre_amp_score
        s += 1
    if prov_pre_net <= threshold_pre_net_score
        s += 1
    s += f_weekday_lever(weekday)
    if prov_count >= threshold_expl_5d
        s += 1
    if prov_pos_14d <= threshold_position_14d
        s += 1
    score := s
    pre_amp_pts := prov_pre_amp
    pre_net_pts := prov_pre_net
    position_14d_pts := prov_pos_14d
    score_locked := false

// ── Score provisoire PM pendant la pre-PM 17h20 -> 18h20 ────────────────────
// Mise a jour live des leviers PM pour que le dashboard PM montre des valeurs
// partielles entre la bascule visuelle 18h00 et l'eval 18h20.
in_pre_pm_window = enable_pm_module and pre_pm_active and utc_total >= pre_pm_start_utc and utc_total < pm_eval_utc and day_id == pre_pm_day
if in_pre_pm_window
    prov_pre_pm_amp = pre_pm_h - pre_pm_l
    prov_pre_pm_net = pre_pm_c - pre_pm_o
    range_14d_now_pm_prov = high_14d - low_14d
    prov_pos_14d_pm = range_14d_now_pm_prov > 0 ? (close - low_14d) / range_14d_now_pm_prov * 100 : 50.0
    int prov_pm_count = 0
    if array.size(recent_pm_expl_days) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(recent_pm_expl_days) - 1
            if array.get(recent_pm_expl_days, i)
                prov_pm_count += 1
    expl_pm_count_5d := prov_pm_count
    // Score provisoire PM, 5 leviers comme la version finale, sans is_fomc
    int sp_prov = 0
    if prov_pre_pm_amp >= threshold_pre_pm_amp
        sp_prov += 1
    if prov_pre_pm_net <= threshold_pre_pm_net
        sp_prov += 1
    if am_expl_today
        sp_prov += 1
    if prov_pm_count >= threshold_pm_expl_5d
        sp_prov += 1
    if prov_pos_14d_pm <= threshold_pm_pos_14d
        sp_prov += 1
    pm_score := sp_prov
    pre_pm_amp_pts := prov_pre_pm_amp
    pre_pm_net_pts := prov_pre_pm_net
    position_14d_pm_pts := prov_pos_14d_pm
    pm_score_locked := false

// ── Score structurel (entre 1h00 et 14h00, avant la pre-NY) ─────────────────
// Recalcul continu du score avec les 3 leviers stables uniquement :
//   weekday, expl_count_5d, position_14d (estimee via close en proxy)
// Les leviers pre_amp/pre_net restent na (affiches en "—" dans le dashboard).
// La classification reste 0 -> fond gris du panneau.
in_structural_window = day_id == daily_reset_day and not pre_active and not score_locked
if in_structural_window
    // Position 14d estimee via close, sera remplacee par open 15h20 au verrouillage
    range_14d_now = high_14d - low_14d
    position_14d_pts := range_14d_now > 0 ? (close - low_14d) / range_14d_now * 100 : 50.0
    // Comptage des explosions dans la fenetre glissante 5 jours
    int struct_count = 0
    if array.size(recent_expl_days) > 0
        for i = 0 to array.size(recent_expl_days) - 1
            if array.get(recent_expl_days, i)
                struct_count += 1
    expl_count_5d := struct_count
    // Score structurel : 3 leviers stables, plage -1 a +3
    int s = 0
    s += f_weekday_lever(weekday)
    if struct_count >= threshold_expl_5d
        s += 1
    if position_14d_pts <= threshold_position_14d
        s += 1
    score := s

// ── Bascule visuelle AM / PM ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
// active_session determine quelle table afficher. PM uniquement si le module est
// active ET (on est dans la fenetre 18h00-20h30 OU on a fait l'eval PM du jour).
// L'eval PM est persistante jusqu'au reset 1h00 : on garde donc le panneau PM
// affiche apres 20h30 jusqu'a minuit, puis retombe en AM.
is_pm_window = enable_pm_module and utc_total >= am_pm_switch_utc and utc_total < pm_end_utc
pm_session_done = enable_pm_module and pm_eval_day == day_id and not is_pm_window
is_pm_visible = is_pm_window or pm_session_done
active_session = is_pm_visible ? "PM" : "AM"

// ── Dashboard ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// Mode Masque : pas d'affichage. Mode Complet : 13 lignes AM ou 14 lignes PM.
// Mode Simplifie : 5 lignes. Les modes Complets ajoutent dash_padding lignes
// transparentes en bas pour empiler un dashboard secondaire au meme coin.
if dash_mode != "Masque" and barstate.islast
    // ── Variables communes AM ─────────────────────────────────────────────
    panel_bg_am = f_class_bg(classification)

    // Etat verdict 15h20, fige a l'evaluation, ne bouge pas a 15h40
    in_structural_phase = day_id == daily_reset_day and not pre_active and classification == 0
    class_15h20_txt = classification_15h20 == 0 ? (in_pre_ny_window ? "EN COURS" : (in_structural_phase ? "Structurel" : "—")) : f_class_text(classification_15h20)
    class_15h20_col = f_class_color(classification_15h20)
    pexpl_15h20 = f_class_pexpl(classification_15h20)

    // Etat ajuste apres bascule 15h40 eventuelle
    past_b2_close = day_id == b2_close_day
    adj_txt = past_b2_close ? f_class_text_short(classification) : "—"
    adj_col = past_b2_close ? f_class_color(classification) : COL_GRAY

    // Activation des leviers AM, pour ticks ✓/✗ du detail
    lev_pre_amp = not na(pre_amp_pts) and pre_amp_pts >= threshold_pre_amp_score
    lev_pre_net = not na(pre_net_pts) and pre_net_pts <= threshold_pre_net_score
    lev_weekday = f_weekday_lever(weekday)
    lev_expl_5d = expl_count_5d >= threshold_expl_5d
    lev_pos_14d = not na(position_14d_pts) and position_14d_pts <= threshold_position_14d

    // Alerte tardive AM
    b12_avail        = day_id == b2_close_day
    b12_range_ok     = b12_avail and b12_range >= threshold_rouge_15h40
    b12_range_text   = b12_avail ? f_fmt_pts(b12_range) : "—"
    b12_dir_text     = b12_avail ? ("B1" + f_dir_arrow(b1_dir) + " B2" + f_dir_arrow(b2_dir)) : "—"
    b12_align_active = b12_avail and b12_aligned

    // ── Variables communes PM ─────────────────────────────────────────────
    panel_bg_pm = f_class_pm_bg(classification_pm)

    // Etat PM verdict 18h20
    pm_pre_active_now = enable_pm_module and pre_pm_active and utc_total < pm_eval_utc
    class_pm_18h20_txt = classification_pm_18h20 == 0 ? (pm_pre_active_now ? "EN COURS" : "—") : f_class_pm_text(classification_pm_18h20)
    class_pm_18h20_col = f_class_pm_color(classification_pm_18h20)
    pexpl_pm_18h20 = f_class_pm_pexpl(classification_pm_18h20)

    // Etat ajuste PM, apres bascule 18h40
    past_pm_b2_close = day_id == pm_b2_close_day
    pm_adj_txt = past_pm_b2_close ? f_class_pm_text_short(classification_pm) : "—"
    pm_adj_col = past_pm_b2_close ? f_class_pm_color(classification_pm) : COL_GRAY

    // Activation des leviers PM
    lev_pre_pm_amp = not na(pre_pm_amp_pts) and pre_pm_amp_pts >= threshold_pre_pm_amp
    lev_pre_pm_net = not na(pre_pm_net_pts) and pre_pm_net_pts <= threshold_pre_pm_net
    lev_am_expl    = am_expl_today
    lev_pm_expl_5d = expl_pm_count_5d >= threshold_pm_expl_5d
    lev_pm_pos_14d = not na(position_14d_pm_pts) and position_14d_pm_pts <= threshold_pm_pos_14d

    // Alerte tardive PM
    pm_b12_avail      = day_id == pm_b2_close_day
    pm_b12_range_ok   = pm_b12_avail and pm_b12_range >= threshold_pm_rouge_18h40
    pm_b12_range_text = pm_b12_avail ? f_fmt_pts(pm_b12_range) : "—"
    pm_b12_dir_text   = pm_b12_avail ? ("B1" + f_dir_arrow(pm_b1_dir) + " B2" + f_dir_arrow(pm_b2_dir)) : "—"

    // Couleur de fond du panneau selon session active
    panel_bg = active_session == "PM" ? panel_bg_pm : panel_bg_am

    // Rappel cross-session
    // En session AM : afficher l'etat PM a venir si module active, sinon tiret
    // En session PM : afficher l'etat AM fige (toujours visible apres 15h20)
    am_ref_txt = classification_15h20 == 0 ? "—" : f_class_text_short(classification_15h20)
    am_ref_col = classification_15h20 == 0 ? COL_GRAY : f_class_color(classification_15h20)
    pm_ref_txt = not enable_pm_module ? "off" : (classification_pm_18h20 == 0 ? "à venir" : f_class_pm_text_short(classification_pm_18h20))
    pm_ref_col = not enable_pm_module ? COL_GRAY : (classification_pm_18h20 == 0 ? COL_GRAY : f_class_pm_color(classification_pm_18h20))

    if dash_mode == "Complet" and dash_show_thresholds
        // ═══ MODE COMPLET 3 COLONNES ════════════════════════════════════════
        // 14 lignes : 13 specifiques a la session + 1 ligne cross-session
        var table tbl_full = table.new(position.bottom_right, 3, 14 + dash_padding, bgcolor=color.new(color.gray, 100), border_width=0)

        if active_session != "PM"
            // ─── Session AM ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
            // Ligne 0 : Etat AM
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 0, "Etat",            bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 0, class_15h20_txt,   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 0, "",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 1 : Score
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 1, "Score",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 1, f_fmt_signed(score),    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 1, "",                     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 2 : P(expl)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 2, "P(expl)",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 2, f_fmt_pct1(pexpl_15h20),  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 2, "",                       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 3 : separateur
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 3, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 3, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 3, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)

            // Ligne 4 : pre_amp
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 4, "pre_amp",            bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 4, f_fmt_pts(pre_amp_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 4, f_check_mark(lev_pre_amp) + " (>= " + str.tostring(threshold_pre_amp_score) + ")", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_pre_amp ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 5 : pre_net
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 5, "pre_net",            bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 5, f_fmt_pts(pre_net_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 5, f_check_mark(lev_pre_net) + " (<= " + str.tostring(threshold_pre_net_score) + ")", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_pre_net ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 6 : weekday
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 6, "weekday",                          bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 6, f_weekday_name(weekday),            bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 6, f_fmt_signed(lev_weekday),          bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_weekday > 0 ? COL_RED : lev_weekday < 0 ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 7 : expl_5d
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 7, "expl_5d",                                  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 7, str.tostring(expl_count_5d),               bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 7, f_check_mark(lev_expl_5d) + " (>= " + str.tostring(threshold_expl_5d) + ")", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_expl_5d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 8 : pos_14d
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 8, "pos_14d",                          bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 8, f_fmt_pct1(position_14d_pts),       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 8, f_check_mark(lev_pos_14d) + " (<= " + str.tostring(threshold_position_14d) + "%)", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_pos_14d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 9 : separateur
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 9, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 9, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 9, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)

            // Ligne 10 : b12 range
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 10, "b12 range",      bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 10, b12_range_text,   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 10, b12_avail ? (f_check_mark(b12_range_ok) + " (>= " + str.tostring(threshold_rouge_15h40) + ")") : "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=b12_range_ok ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 11 : b12 align
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 11, "b12 align",      bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 11, b12_dir_text,     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 11, b12_avail ? f_check_mark(b12_align_active) : "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=b12_align_active ? COL_GREEN : (b12_avail ? COL_RED : COL_GRAY), text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 12 : Etat ajuste AM
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 12, "Etat ajuste",    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 12, adj_txt,          bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=adj_col,  text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 12, "",               bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 13 : Cross-session — Etat PM a venir
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 13, "Etat PM",        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 13, pm_ref_txt,       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=pm_ref_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 13, "",               bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)
        else
            // ─── Session PM ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
            // Ligne 0 : Cross-session — Etat AM fige
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 0, "Etat AM",         bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 0, am_ref_txt,        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=am_ref_col,  text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 0, "",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 1 : Etat PM, juste sous Etat AM
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 1, "Etat PM",             bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 1, class_pm_18h20_txt,    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 1, "",                    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 2 : Score PM
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 2, "Score",                   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 2, f_fmt_signed(pm_score),    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 2, "",                        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 3 : P(expl) PM
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 3, "P(expl)",                    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 3, f_fmt_pct1(pexpl_pm_18h20),   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 3, "",                           bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 4 : separateur
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 4, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 4, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 4, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)

            // Ligne 5 : pre_pm_amp
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 5, "pre_pm_amp",              bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 5, f_fmt_pts(pre_pm_amp_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 5, f_check_mark(lev_pre_pm_amp) + " (>= " + str.tostring(threshold_pre_pm_amp) + ")", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_pre_pm_amp ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 6 : pre_pm_net
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 6, "pre_pm_net",              bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 6, f_fmt_pts(pre_pm_net_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 6, f_check_mark(lev_pre_pm_net) + " (<= " + str.tostring(threshold_pre_pm_net) + ")", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_pre_pm_net ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 7 : am_expl
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 7, "am_expl",                  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 7, am_expl_today ? "True" : "False", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 7, f_check_mark(lev_am_expl), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_am_expl ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 8 : expl_pm_5d
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 8, "expl_pm_5d",                       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 8, str.tostring(expl_pm_count_5d),     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 8, f_check_mark(lev_pm_expl_5d) + " (>= " + str.tostring(threshold_pm_expl_5d) + ")", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_pm_expl_5d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 9 : pos_14d_pm
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 9, "pos_14d_pm",                       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 9, f_fmt_pct1(position_14d_pm_pts),    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 9, f_check_mark(lev_pm_pos_14d) + " (<= " + str.tostring(threshold_pm_pos_14d) + "%)", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=lev_pm_pos_14d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 10 : is_fomc
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 10, "is_fomc",                                   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 10, is_fomc_today ? "True" : "False",            bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=is_fomc_today ? COL_RED : COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 10, is_fomc_today ? f_check_mark(true) : "",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_RED, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 11 : separateur, isole la confirmation finale
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 11, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 11, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 11, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)

            // Ligne 12 : b12 range PM
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 12, "b12 range",       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 12, pm_b12_range_text, bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_BLUE, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 12, pm_b12_avail ? (f_check_mark(pm_b12_range_ok) + " (>= " + str.tostring(threshold_pm_rouge_18h40) + ")") : "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=pm_b12_range_ok ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)

            // Ligne 13 : Etat ajuste PM
            table.cell(tbl_full, 0, 13, "Etat ajuste",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 1, 13, pm_adj_txt,        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=pm_adj_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_full, 2, 13, "",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.small)

        // Lignes de padding transparent (commun AM/PM)
        if dash_padding > 0
            for r = 14 to 14 + dash_padding - 1
                for c = 0 to 2
                    table.cell(tbl_full, c, r, "", text_size=size.small)

    if dash_mode == "Complet" and not dash_show_thresholds
        // ═══ MODE COMPLET 2 COLONNES ════════════════════════════════════════
        // 14 lignes, sans 3e colonne, couleur des leviers indique validation
        var table tbl_compact = table.new(position.bottom_right, 2, 14 + dash_padding, bgcolor=color.new(color.gray, 100), border_width=0)

        if active_session != "PM"
            // ─── Session AM ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
            col_pre_amp = lev_pre_amp ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_pre_net = lev_pre_net ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_weekday = lev_weekday > 0 ? COL_RED : lev_weekday < 0 ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_expl_5d = lev_expl_5d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_pos_14d = lev_pos_14d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_b12_range = b12_range_ok ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_b12_align = b12_align_active ? COL_GREEN : (b12_avail ? COL_RED : COL_GRAY)

            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 0, "Etat",            bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 0, class_15h20_txt,   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 1, "Score",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 1, f_fmt_signed(score),    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 2, "P(expl)",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 2, f_fmt_pct1(pexpl_15h20),  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 3, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 3, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 4, "pre_amp",              bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 4, f_fmt_pts(pre_amp_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pre_amp, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 5, "pre_net",              bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 5, f_fmt_pts(pre_net_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pre_net, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 6, "weekday",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 6, f_weekday_name(weekday),  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_weekday, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 7, "expl_5d",                       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 7, str.tostring(expl_count_5d),     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_expl_5d, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 8, "pos_14d",                  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 8, f_fmt_pct1(position_14d_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pos_14d, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 9, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 9, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 10, "b12 range",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,      text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 10, b12_range_text,  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_b12_range, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 11, "b12 align",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,      text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 11, b12_dir_text,    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_b12_align, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 12, "Etat ajuste",   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 12, adj_txt,         bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=adj_col,  text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 13, "Etat PM",       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 13, pm_ref_txt,      bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=pm_ref_col, text_size=size.small)
        else
            // ─── Session PM ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
            col_pre_pm_amp = lev_pre_pm_amp ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_pre_pm_net = lev_pre_pm_net ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_am_expl    = lev_am_expl    ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_pm_expl_5d = lev_pm_expl_5d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_pm_pos_14d = lev_pm_pos_14d ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_pm_b12     = pm_b12_range_ok ? COL_GREEN : COL_GRAY
            col_is_fomc    = is_fomc_today ? COL_RED : COL_GRAY

            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 0, "Etat AM",        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 0, am_ref_txt,       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=am_ref_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 1, "Etat PM",             bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 1, class_pm_18h20_txt,    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 2, "Score",                   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 2, f_fmt_signed(pm_score),    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 3, "P(expl)",                  bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 3, f_fmt_pct1(pexpl_pm_18h20), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 4, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 4, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 5, "pre_pm_amp",              bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,       text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 5, f_fmt_pts(pre_pm_amp_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pre_pm_amp, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 6, "pre_pm_net",              bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,       text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 6, f_fmt_pts(pre_pm_net_pts), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pre_pm_net, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 7, "am_expl",                       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 7, am_expl_today ? "True" : "False", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_am_expl, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 8, "expl_pm_5d",                       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,       text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 8, str.tostring(expl_pm_count_5d),     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pm_expl_5d, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 9, "pos_14d_pm",                       bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,       text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 9, f_fmt_pct1(position_14d_pm_pts),    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pm_pos_14d, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 10, "is_fomc",                          bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,    text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 10, is_fomc_today ? "True" : "False",   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_is_fomc, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 11, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 11, "", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_size=size.tiny)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 12, "b12 range",      bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 12, pm_b12_range_text, bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=col_pm_b12, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 0, 13, "Etat ajuste",   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_compact, 1, 13, pm_adj_txt,      bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=pm_adj_col, text_size=size.small)

        if dash_padding > 0
            for r = 14 to 14 + dash_padding - 1
                for c = 0 to 1
                    table.cell(tbl_compact, c, r, "", text_size=size.small)

    if dash_mode == "Simplifie"
        // ═══ MODE SIMPLIFIE : 2 colonnes x 5 lignes (+ padding) ═════════════
        // AM : NY AM titre / Etat AM / P(expl) AM / Etat ajusté AM / Etat PM
        // PM : NY PM titre / Etat AM (figé) / Etat PM / P(expl) PM / Etat ajusté PM
        var table tbl_s = table.new(position.bottom_right, 2, 5 + dash_padding, bgcolor=color.new(color.gray, 100), border_width=0)

        if active_session != "PM"
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 0, "NY AM",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 0, "risk expl", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 1, "Etat",            bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 1, class_15h20_txt,   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 2, "P(expl)",                 bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,        text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 2, f_fmt_pct1(pexpl_15h20),   bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_15h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 3, "Etat ajuste",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 3, adj_txt,           bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=adj_col,  text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 4, "Etat PM",         bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 4, pm_ref_txt,        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=pm_ref_col, text_size=size.small)
        else
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 0, "NY PM",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 0, "risk expl", bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 1, "Etat AM",         bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 1, am_ref_txt,        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=am_ref_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 2, "Etat PM",             bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 2, class_pm_18h20_txt,    bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 3, "P(expl)",                bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,           text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 3, f_fmt_pct1(pexpl_pm_18h20), bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=class_pm_18h20_col, text_size=size.small)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 0, 4, "Etat ajuste",     bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=COL_GRAY,   text_size=size.small, text_halign=text.align_left)
            table.cell(tbl_s, 1, 4, pm_adj_txt,        bgcolor=panel_bg, text_color=pm_adj_col, text_size=size.small)

        if dash_padding > 0
            for r = 5 to 5 + dash_padding - 1
                for c = 0 to 1
                    table.cell(tbl_s, c, r, "", text_size=size.small)

// ── Detection FVG (greffon inchange depuis v1.2) ─────────────────────────────
// Pattern Fair Value Gap, evalue sur trois bougies cloturees consecutives :
//   bar[3] = bougie precedente, bar[2] = bougie FVG, bar[1] = bougie suivante.
//   - Bullish FVG : low[1]  > high[3], la bougie [2] est dans le trou haussier
//   - Bearish FVG : high[1] < low[3],  la bougie [2] est dans le trou baissier
// La detection a 2 bougies de delai car il faut que bar[1] soit cloturee.
// On filtre les petits gaps via fvg_min_pts pour eviter la pollution visuelle.
fvg_gap_bull   = low[1] - high[3]
fvg_gap_bear   = low[3] - high[1]
is_bullish_fvg = fvg_gap_bull > 0 and fvg_gap_bull >= fvg_min_pts
is_bearish_fvg = fvg_gap_bear > 0 and fvg_gap_bear >= fvg_min_pts
is_fvg         = is_bullish_fvg or is_bearish_fvg

// Repaint retroactif via barcolor(offset=-2) : la bougie cible (bar[2]) est
// repeinte 2 positions en arriere. Note : barcolor colore la bougie entiere
// (corps + meches). plotcandle ne supporte pas offset en Pine v6.
barcolor(show_fvg and is_fvg ? fvg_color : na, offset=-2, title="FVG candle")
